    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy</string>
    <string name="privacy_text">The server keeps your email, a hash of your password, your name, your phone number, your group or picked subjects and your language. If you report a timetable problem, authorized timetable staff can see your name, email, description and the class details. It keeps no location, contacts or usage tracking. Deleting your account also removes your reports.</string>
